---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { breadcrumbSchema, personSchema } from "../../utils/seo";

const siteUrl = "https://www.healthymindspecialists.com";
const staffName = "Steven Borrero, LMHC";
const staffRole = "Licensed Therapist";
const staffSlug = "steven-borrero-lmhc";
const tagline =
  "Meaningful change begins with feeling safe enough to be yourself.";
const profileImage =
  "https://imagedelivery.net/B5r6pMfQRTYBHyjgaDFr8w/9c9bf0a3-cf2f-4e59-78a3-c3838652b800/public";

const schemas = [
  personSchema({
    displayName: staffName,
    jobTitle: staffRole,
    url: `${siteUrl}/staff/${staffSlug}`,
    image: profileImage,
    siteUrl,
  }),
  breadcrumbSchema([
    { name: "Home", url: siteUrl },
    { name: "About Us", url: `${siteUrl}/about` },
    { name: staffName, url: `${siteUrl}/staff/${staffSlug}` },
  ]),
];
---

<Layout
  title={staffName}
  description={`Meet ${staffName}, ${staffRole} at Healthy Mind Specialists in Tampa, FL. Bilingual therapy in English and Spanish for children, adolescents, and adults navigating anxiety, depression, trauma, ADHD, and LGBTQ+ concerns.`}
  schema={schemas}
  navOnLight
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class='relative calm-gradient pt-36 pb-20 md:pt-44 md:pb-24 overflow-hidden'>
    <div
      class='absolute -top-40 -right-32 w-[520px] h-[520px] rounded-full bg-calm-lavender/80 blur-[130px] calm-float pointer-events-none'
      aria-hidden='true'
    >
    </div>
    <div
      class='absolute -bottom-44 -left-40 w-[480px] h-[480px] rounded-full bg-calm-blush/70 blur-[140px] calm-float-slow pointer-events-none'
      aria-hidden='true'
    >
    </div>

    <div
      class='relative max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-10 md:px-16 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center'
    >
      <div class='lg:col-span-7 order-2 lg:order-1'>
        <span
          class='inline-flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-full border border-brand-gold/30 bg-brand-white/60 px-4 py-1.5 font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-brand-gold-dark mb-8'
        >
          <span class='w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-brand-gold' aria-hidden='true'
          ></span>
          Therapy in English and Spanish
        </span>
        <h1
          class='text-5xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-display font-semibold text-brand-charcoal leading-[0.95] tracking-[-0.015em]'
        >
          {staffName}
        </h1>
        <p
          class='mt-5 text-xl md:text-2xl font-display italic text-brand-gold-dark'
        >
          {staffRole}
        </p>
        <p
          class='mt-7 text-brand-charcoal/65 text-lg font-light leading-relaxed max-w-xl'
        >
          {tagline}
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class='lg:col-span-5 order-1 lg:order-2'>
        <div class='relative mx-auto max-w-xs sm:max-w-sm lg:max-w-none'>
          <div
            class='absolute -inset-3 rounded-t-[999px] rounded-b-[2.5rem] border border-brand-gold/25 pointer-events-none'
            aria-hidden='true'
          >
          </div>
          <div
            class='relative h-[360px] sm:h-[440px] lg:h-[480px] overflow-hidden rounded-t-[999px] rounded-b-[2.5rem] bg-calm-lavender'
          >
            <img
              src={profileImage}
              alt={`Portrait of ${staffName}, ${staffRole} at Healthy Mind Specialists`}
              width='768'
              height='768'
              class='w-full h-full object-cover object-top'
              loading='eager'
              fetchpriority='high'
            />
            <div
              class='absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-gold/30 via-transparent to-calm-blush/40 mix-blend-soft-light pointer-events-none'
              aria-hidden='true'
            >
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Main Content -->
  <section class='bg-brand-white py-20 md:py-28'>
    <div class='max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6'>
      <!-- Bio Content -->
      <span
        class='font-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.3em] uppercase text-brand-muted block mb-6'
      >
        About Steven
      </span>
      <div
        class='max-w-none text-brand-charcoal/70 text-lg font-light leading-relaxed space-y-7'
      >
        <p>
          Starting therapy can feel intimidating, especially when you are unsure
          whether you will feel understood, accepted, or comfortable being
          yourself. My goal is to create a space where you can settle in, feel
          respected, and talk openly about what is happening in your life
          without fear of judgment. Clients often experience me as relaxed,
          gentle, patient, and encouraging, and I believe meaningful change
          begins with feeling safe enough to be yourself.
        </p>
        <p>
          As a Licensed Mental Health Counselor, I work with children,
          adolescents, and adults navigating anxiety, depression, trauma,
          relationship and family concerns, ADHD, neurodivergence, grief, mood
          difficulties, self-esteem, and other life challenges. I have worked
          with people from many different backgrounds and life experiences,
          including LGBTQ+ individuals, veterans, individuals involved in foster
          care, and those who have experienced homelessness. I am especially
          passionate about working with LGBTQ+ individuals and people from
          diverse cultural backgrounds, as well as helping clients develop
          practical coping skills for managing mental health concerns.
        </p>
        <p>
          I take a holistic, mind-body-spirit approach to therapy because
          emotional well-being does not exist in isolation. Our thoughts,
          physical health, relationships, cultural experiences, behaviors, and
          sense of meaning and purpose can all influence how we experience
          ourselves and the world around us. I often incorporate Cognitive
          Behavioral Therapy (CBT) to help clients understand connections
          between thoughts, emotions, and behaviors, while adapting our work to
          your individual needs, experiences, and goals.
        </p>
        <p>
          As a proud, openly gay Colombian American man, I bring personal and
          cultural perspective to my work and understand the importance of
          having spaces where you can feel seen without having to explain or
          minimize important parts of who you are. I provide therapy in both
          English and Spanish and am committed to creating an affirming,
          culturally responsive environment for clients from all backgrounds.
        </p>
        <p>
          Outside of the therapy room, I enjoy spending time with my husband,
          family, friends, and our two dogs. I love traveling, going to the
          beach, working out, movies, music, dancing, nature, and exploring new
          places. I am also a foodie and am always happy to discover somewhere
          new to eat.
        </p>
        <p>
          Wherever you are starting from, you do not have to have everything
          figured out before coming to therapy. We can begin where you are and
          work together toward greater understanding, healthier ways of coping,
          and meaningful change.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <div class='mt-16 text-center'>
        <a
          href='/contact'
          class='inline-flex items-center px-8 py-4 bg-brand-gold-dark text-white text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.06em] uppercase rounded-full transition-all duration-400 hover:bg-brand-blue-light'
        >
          Schedule a Consultation
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
